वसूनां पावकश्चास्मि मेरु: शिखरिणामहम् ॥ २३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2992,\"bb\":2648,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/10/23/b2648/\",\"body_value\":\"rudrāṇāṁ śaṅkaraś cāsmi
vitteśo yakṣa-rakṣasām
